Package: rmai
Title: Run 'mai' Code from R
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Michael", "Sumner", email = "mdsumner@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Brendan", "McArdle", role = "ctb",
           comment = "author of the mai language, compiler and VM"))
Description: Helpers for 'mai', the compiled statistical computing language
    described in Brendan McArdle's 2018 University of Auckland PhD thesis
    "A Compiled Language for Statistical Computing". Run 'mai' code and
    scripts from R, time 'mai' against R, build the 'mai' executable from
    source, and write 'mai' chunks in R Markdown and Quarto documents through
    a 'knitr' engine.
License: GPL-2
URL: https://github.com/mai-lib/rmai, https://github.com/mai-lib/mai
BugReports: https://github.com/mai-lib/rmai/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
Imports:
    tools,
    utils
Suggests:
    knitr,
    rmarkdown,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
VignetteBuilder: knitr
Config/testthat/edition: 3
RoxygenNote: 7.3.1
